      "text": "The reviewed preview source was retained at 784b139753a0e2a07d3f97eedb326debfe068395; no runtime pin or shared capability changes were required. Engine implementation, public API, package/logger changes, and engine design were marked N/A, while widgets, themes, navigation, presentation, restaurant workflows, and interaction safeguards remained consumer-owned. | When: October 29, 2026 | This preserves the reviewed boundary between the engine and consumer projects.",
