    {
      "id": "298c2418-c44c-45ea-a23d-5c3adffda1a3",
      "text": "The reviewed Madar engine source is committed locally at `6d4ae39f35b005dfa1123a82c6df316901e1e1e4` for the local-only device-preferences capability. Dakhl_Restaurant consumes application `0.1.0-dev.2`, data `0.1.0-dev.1`, and native-adapter `0.1.0-dev.1` through sibling package paths with an immutable manifest and lockfile. Resolved-source, version, and package-boundary validation passed. The consumer must not replace this exact pin solely because newer documentation exists; newer source or versions require deliberate review and verification.",
