    {
      "id": "c73365eb-e6f5-49b5-814d-012f09242a48",
      "text": "Engine contract/data adapter and documentation were independently reviewed with no actionable findings. The reviewed source hashes were verified, and local commit `6d4ae39f35b005dfa1123a82c6df316901e1e1e4` was created for `feat(data): add local-only device preferences capability`; the commit is local and is not guaranteed to be fetchable by hosted CI until authorized publication. | When: October 29, 2026 | Involving: Lead and Independent Reviewer | The handoff required verified reviewed source and explicit separation between local work and publishable CI dependencies.",
